==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|wunde}}, from {{inh|de|goh|wunta}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*wundō||a wound}}, from {{m|gem-pro|*wundaz||wounded}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*h₂wen-}}. Compare {{cog|nds|Wunn}}, {{cog|nl|wond}}, {{cog|en|wound}}, {{cog|is|und}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈvʊn.də/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Wunde.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f}}

# [[sore]], [[wound]]
